<title>INDIA: India Gujarat Ambuja 95/96 net up 47 pct.</title>
<headline>India Gujarat Ambuja 95/96 net up 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   1,478.2  vs    1,004.8</p>
<p>    Net sales	    7,303.5  vs    4,290.3</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)	 20.0  vs	 13.7</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  5.0  vs	  4.0</p>
<p>    Other income	    81.8  vs	398.6</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  4,760.8  vs    3,103.5</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 548.5  vs	275.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   597.3  vs	303.9</p>
<p>    Wealth Tax		 0.5  vs	  0.9</p>
<p>    Income Tax	     nil    vs	nil</p>
<p>Note: Gujarat Ambuja Cements said it would start production at its new one million tonne cement plant in Gujarat by December 1996. This will take total capacity to 4.5 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
